        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V3EpdP6h8otW8txgceal6jcTgJe\"><em><strong>The two charts below show the proportion of qualified graduates in a particular country. To summarize information by selecting key characteristics and compiling a report and, if necessary, make a comparison.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Proportion of Qualified Graduates</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BO4RdscnIoPwkkx5yDjlhHLVgDh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-pie-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Pie Charts</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CK4ad16YSoWIyZxGkNjlSmh6gLp\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Proportion of Qualified Graduates y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả <strong>phần trăm sinh vi&ecirc;n tốt nghiệp ng&agrave;nh Arts v&agrave; Science với 3 tr&igrave;nh độ kh&aacute;c nhau ở 1 nước v&agrave;o năm 1980 v&agrave; 2008</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WCVsdCI1cosYyrxHIqDlR42jgle\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <strong><a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</span></a></strong>&nbsp;trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9JEd3ji6oFD9oxKigHlZwc9gPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Proportion of Qualified Graduates với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: <strong>tỷ lệ sinh vi&ecirc;n - nhiều tr&igrave;nh độ - Arts v&agrave; Science - ở 1 nước - 1980 v&agrave; 2008</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LYyCdKty9oTs1lxEuizleCqqgrb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Pie Graphs</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong><a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-pie\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng PIE</span></a></strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong>&nbsp;</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LRsld2kacoGUJ0xzjNClSS8rgAc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kf6tdvPCXoR5HIxMq0SlNnMggHh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>hầu hết c&aacute;c loại bằng cấp trải qua những thay đổi tương đối khi&ecirc;m tốn, với c&aacute;c bằng PhD tăng đ&aacute;ng kể ở cả hai lĩnh vực, trong khi việc đạt được First Degree lại giảm ở cả hai ng&agrave;nh học.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B7NXdRCmto9bHkxdm36l02L8gRh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Master and PhD Science lu&ocirc;n chiếm tỷ lệ lớn nhất trong số c&aacute;c sinh vi&ecirc;n tốt nghiệp ở cả hai năm.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AHYadYbOBoXsPsxOrWqlCUxQgld\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Tr&igrave;nh độ PhD</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CWowdAuhLoZPJPxdusflQ26cgPc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HU6Vd57gmojNYKxKINBlHcf1g0d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1980 </strong><em>(PhD Science chiếm một phần tư tr&ecirc;n tổng số bằng cấp, cao hơn nhiều so với bằng PhD Art, chỉ c&oacute; 2%</em><em>)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UjpndQsvqoaD6JxuExelON2ngIg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của hai bằng v&agrave;o năm 2008&nbsp;</strong><em>(PhD Science tăng l&ecirc;n 30%, trở th&agrave;nh tr&igrave;nh độ phổ biến nhất, trong khi PhD Art tăng đ&aacute;ng kể, hơn gấp 3 lần l&ecirc;n 7%</em><em>)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuxRdF0GuoF09YxnotEl2yn7gbj\">&nbsp;\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YtVadGsFDouLwBxQ7L1l4VwHghc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Tr&igrave;nh độ Master v&agrave; First Degree</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YtVadGsFDouLwBxQ7L1l4VwHghc\">\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"33\">Theo </span><strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34\">Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></span></strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"35\">, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YtVadGsFDouLwBxQ7L1l4VwHghc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HU6Vd57gmojNYKxKINBlHcf1g0d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1980 của trỉnh độ Master&nbsp;</strong><em>(Master Science chiếm 29% tổng số sinh vi&ecirc;n tốt nghiệp, vượt xa bằng Master Art ở mức 13%.</em><em>)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li>(Step 2)&nbsp;<strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của hai bằng trỉnh độ Master v&agrave;o năm 2008&nbsp;</strong><em>(Master Science giữ nguy&ecirc;n ở mức 29%, trong khi Master Art giảm nhẹ xuống 12%</em><em>)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HU6Vd57gmojNYKxKINBlHcf1g0d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3)&nbsp;<strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1980 của trỉnh độ First degree&nbsp;</strong><em>(First Degree Science chiếm 20%, torng khi First Degree Art l&agrave; 11%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li>(Step 4) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của hai bằng trỉnh độ First Degree v&agrave;o năm 2008 </strong><em>(cả hai đều giảm, số liệu lần lượt cho Science v&agrave; Art l&agrave; 12% v&agrave; 10%</em><em>)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;Khi n&oacute;i về những người&nbsp;<strong>\"tốt nghiệp với bằng...\"</strong> th&igrave; ngo&agrave;i c&aacute;ch diễn đạt <strong>\"... degree graduates\"</strong> th&igrave; m&igrave;nh cũng c&oacute; thể n&oacute;i <strong>\"những người c&oacute; bằng...\"</strong> đ&oacute; với cụm <strong>\"... degree holders\"</strong> nha.</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BCKJd4fL9oPDEXxJkgJlncfjg3e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fj4adN3S8oY5PxxD8HJlqc0Kg2c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">the data reveals that most qualification types experienced relatively modest changes, with Ph.D degree holders increased notably in both fields</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 399,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NKVOdtm6NoKXBoxokt5lXO2Egte\">The pie charts illustrate the proportions of graduates with different levels of qualifications in Arts and Science fields in a particular country for two years, namely 1980 and 2008.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13787,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 400,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SzhAdV7S7ou9lOxIpX1lodUMgxh\">Overall, most qualification types experienced relatively modest changes, with Ph.D degree holders increasing notably in both fields, whereas first degree attainment declined across both disciplines. Additionally, Master and Ph.D of Science represented the largest proportion of graduates in both years.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13787,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 401,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PoVad7soroBT3ZxNvPZlSXxPgrj\">Regarding postgraduate qualifications at the doctoral level, Ph.D Science accounted for a quarter of all degrees in 1980, significantly higher than Ph.D Art, which represented merely 2% of graduates. By 2008, Ph.D Science had risen to 30%, becoming the most common qualification. Similarly, Ph.D Art experienced dramatic growth, more than tripling to 7%.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13787,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 402,
